<title>FINLAND: VIKING SAYS ROSELLA TO START &quot;DANCE CRUISES&quot;.</title>
<headline>VIKING SAYS ROSELLA TO START &quot;DANCE CRUISES&quot;.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Finnish passenger ferry operator Viking Line Ab said on Tuesday its Rosella ferry will start offering 24-hour dance cruises from Stockholm to the Aland islands in April-June.</p>
<p>&quot;There will be live music for 13 hours with two orchestras and a Swedish crew,&quot; Viking Line said in a statement.</p>
<p>Viking also confirmed that the Rosella will start operating on the Turku-Aland-Kapellskar route in mid-June.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +358 -9 - 6805 0248</p>
</text>
